ShelfBuddy – BEX3202 AI-Built MVP
ShelfBuddy helps users track groceries, prioritise food approaching expiry and generate AI-powered Smart Meal suggestions.  

AI: Google Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite  

Local setup:
npm install
Create a .env file based on .env.example and provide a valid Gemini API key.
Run the application using the project development commands.  

Sensitive API credentials are not included in this repository.
